WEBVTT

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:30.663
and pounded it back
like a shot of whiskey.

00:17:30.697 --> 00:17:32.530
(Laughter)

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:37.063
She looked at my dad and smiled,

00:17:37.097 --> 00:17:38.597
closed her eyes.

00:17:38.597 --> 00:17:40.930
And in 45 minutes she was gone.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.530
I know the experience
that we had is not common.

00:17:50.797 --> 00:17:52.297
For many people,

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:55.797
they don't get the chance to say goodbye
the way that we did.

00:17:56.997 --> 00:17:59.863
For some, death is full of uncertainty

00:17:59.863 --> 00:18:02.997
and can often be a waiting game.